      "B": "The liquidation has no P&L impact because LIFO is a cost flow assumption, not a physical flow. Titan will replenish inventory in Q4, restoring the LIFO layers, so the Q3 liquidation is a temporary phenomenon that self-corrects. No separate disclosure is required; Titan should note the strike in MD&A without quantifying the LIFO effect.",
